  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Usuarios del programa PRODESAL Maullín recibieron la entrega de vientres ovinos de alta genética, gracias al Incentivo de Fomento Productivo (IFP) de INDAP, iniciativa que busca fortalecer la producción ovina y el desarrollo de la agricultura familiar campesina.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">En esta oportunidad, los beneficiarios fueron:</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📍\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png\"/> Las Chilcas: Moisés Ojeda, quien recibió nuevos ejemplares para fortalecer su plantel ovino.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📍\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png\"/> Camino Los Laureles, Cariquilda: Emilia Oyarzo, beneficiaria de cinco vientres ovinos que contribuirán a mejorar la genética y productividad de su predio.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👏\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tfe/1/16/1f44f.png\"/> Esta iniciativa es fruto del trabajo conjunto entre INDAP, PRODESAL Maullín y los propios agricultores, quienes continúan impulsando el desarrollo del campo y la producción local.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🌱\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t69/1/16/1f331.png\"/> Seguimos apoyando a quienes hacen crecer el mundo rural de nuestra comuna.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11361\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/lqrz9957lqadnvt/prodesal_01_1024x682_6ml7sm9mvs.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-98 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11354\" data-id=\"11354\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/6de15hyabu30fcr/prodesal_02_1024x682_6129f4j6h5.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11365\" data-id=\"11365\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/vbwnk2oxdoowdj3/prodesal_03_1024x682_hzmsqfud79.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11366\" data-id=\"11366\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/pqbn22bx2wcnk3w/prodesal_04_1024x682_a4r8jlujor.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11359\" data-id=\"11359\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/g601s90gohb4